{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n肥幾磅都要食!極濃花生醬味\n</p>\n<h2>人氣網店推全新奶醬多千層餅！</h2>\n<p>人氣港式古法千層餅網店「Mille HK（一專）」又有驚喜新搞作！繼之前玩味十足嘅一斤芫荽千層餅之後，今次推出快閃限定「奶醬多千層餅」。這款全新「奶醬多千層餅」完美還原茶記奶醬多的靈魂，師傅在極致酥脆的千層皮之間，鋪上厚厚一層嘅特濃花生醬，質感極度濃郁順滑，花生醬味勁濃。最正嘅係中間夾雜住絲滑嘅邪惡煉奶，整體口感更加豐腴香甜。鹹甜平衡得恰到好處，完全不會覺得死甜死實，味道層次高級感滿滿！</p>\n<p>Mille HK 一專<br/>\n官方IG：@mille_h</p>\n<p>【知道香港人超級忙，忙到無時間諗食乜玩乜買乜，「新假期吃喝玩樂」 幫你每日精選玩樂、食買靈感，一網打盡全港食買玩熱點！想分享你嘅最愛地點？DM 我哋，一齊帶出港人生活新態度！】</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179446322321232622_18893697036af555f7a8551.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179446322321232622_18893697036af555f7a8551.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179446322584495083_14114758816af555fa3538d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179446322584495083_14114758816af555fa3538d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179446322765910728_2156013346af555fc138f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179446322765910728_2156013346af555fc138f0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179446322950613509_15034224276af555fe0f626.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179446322950613509_15034224276af555fe0f626.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfoGA9NiVR0/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T06:23:50.609951+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":446,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:00:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:38:04.445643+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:17:23.811503+00:00","content_hash":"041d9036bb323acdcfe6dd52c58f708d465c331941d337ce6e241809f496ee92","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}